# The maintainers who may sign a services release tag, one line each in ssh-keygen allowed_signers
# form: an email address, then the public key of the SSH key that signs. verify-images.sh checks
# release tags against this file, and the file must hold the same lines as the repository's
# SERVICES_RELEASE_SIGNERS variable, which the release workflow checks with. With no line, nothing
# is deployed.
